      "note": "Orban 6300 brochure (downloaded, read as text): digital AES audio, 1 stereo input on XLR, 2 stereo outputs on XLR, 1 word clock or AES11id (75 ohm) sync input (taken as BNC: the type is the usual one for 75 ohm sync, the sheet does not name it), Ethernet for remote control. Not modelled: Ethernet (a control port: the category template would route audio through it) and the mains inlet (not named in the pages read, so no power control). Size 483 x 362 x 45 mm (1U, manufacturer). All positions are guesses (no panel drawing read)."
